  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Disproportionation reaction: In this type of reaction, same elemental species gets oxidised&nbsp;as well as reduced.</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mtext>Na</mtext><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><mover><mtext>Br</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mtext>Cl</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>0</mn></mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mtext>Na</mtext><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><mover><mtext>Cl</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mtext>Br</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>0</mn></mover><mo>-</mo></math>not disproportionate,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></math>not disproportionate,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mover><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</